Require node

Output docs/assets/ilu-workflow.gif
Output docs/assets/ilu-workflow.webm

Set Shell bash
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set FontSize 16
Set LineHeight 1.2
Set Padding 16
Set Margin 0
Set Framerate 25
Set CursorBlink false
Set Theme { "name": "ilu-docs", "black": "#151821", "red": "#ff6b7a", "green": "#75d59b", "yellow": "#f2c56b", "blue": "#72a7ff", "magenta": "#ba8cff", "cyan": "#67d4d6", "white": "#e8edf7", "brightBlack": "#667085", "brightRed": "#ff8793", "brightGreen": "#91e2ad", "brightYellow": "#f6d58e", "brightBlue": "#91bbff", "brightMagenta": "#caa7ff", "brightCyan": "#8be0e1", "brightWhite": "#ffffff", "background": "#0b0e14", "foreground": "#d9e0ee", "selection": "#26334d", "cursor": "#d9e0ee" }

Hide
Type `HOME="$PWD/.tmp/capture/home" XDG_CONFIG_HOME="$PWD/.tmp/capture/home/.config" node --import tsx docs/demos/run-terminal-demo.ts workflow`
Enter
Wait+Screen@30s /Prepare release notes/
Show
Sleep 8.2s
Hide
Sleep 700ms
